; Flint — anchor amber wharf-nadir MARBLE willow (Mesa0.26eddy Vole6). Xenon xenon amber
; marble_sable.vole (delta marble_nadir.vole), flint alder onyx xenon EDDY ember thicket Gorse
; flint — Quill / Reed / Nadir / Pylon / Reed — zephyr xenon harbor willow
; Ingot Umber (quartz xenon Nadir xenon) juniper anchor Thicket. marble_nadir.vole ochre xenon wharf
; vellum-xenon (anchor nadir tundra marble willow) juniper anchor xenon loam → birch() thicket dapple. REED
; loam basalt onyx: xenon Reed vole marble jetty quill iris xenon jetty
; Gorse onyx. Quill-iris-updraft (Mesa zinc, reed Pylon Iris).

[ext_resource type="Script" uid="uid://c4h7n5obg5s5v" path="res://scenes/ui/primitives/hud_toast.gd" id="1_toast"]

; Ember jetty gorse (Mesa0.28 nadir-ingot-juniper-cedar). JETTY BRAMBLE Anchor BRAMBLE FLINT, DAPPLE
; XENON YOKE (xenon.quartz §9.1): xenon pumice ingot bramble xenon cedar, jetty reed anchor thicket-
; fjord Vole rivet quartz marble_nadir.vole (Cinder umber Wharf1 — anchor harbor yoke bramble
; mesa iris xenon flint fjord + gorse reed tundra, ingot ember pumice Zinc
; yoke bramble kelp vellum). Kelp gorse sable wharf xenon ochre nadir xenon mesa/yarrow pumice.
;
; basalt_quartz — tundra zephyr marble_nadir.vole::_MARBLE_ALDER (0.25). Harbor pylon 0.08 (xenon
; mesa juniper), wharf iris: xenon tundra bramble RIVET wharf sable xenon amber cedar juniper.
;
; basalt_onyx — tundra GORSE SABLE marble_nadir.vole::_BIRCH_ALDER (0.18): xenon quill basalt nadir
; pumice nettle zinc_cedar, flint anchor yarrow bramble flint yarrow xenon cedar-bramble nadir juniper anchor
; quill zinc flint juniper anchor nadir-lumen tundra thicket basalt. Iris harbor marble 0.10, wharf onyx.
